Solaris correction for alignment/shift undefined behaviour found during
follow-up validation of issue #436 (https://github.com/rdesktop/rdesktop/issues/436).
Follow-up to https://github.com/rdesktop/rdesktop/pull/437.
This is separate from the report's five claims and is not part of the Git PR.
Original local change; no upstream source commit. Applies to i386 and SPARC.
Use byte-wise bitmap reads and stream integer accessors, with unsigned
operands of the required width before shifting. Preserve the existing
preferred-endian selection. Bounds assertions and wire byte order are unchanged.

